<string name="bp_group">Bit-perfect</string>
    <string name="bp_title">Bit-perfect playback (USB DAC)</string>
    <string name="bp_note">Sends on-device songs to a USB DAC at their own sample rate and bit depth, with no resampling, mixing or effects. Needs Android 14 or later and a DAC that supports it. While it is on, other sounds may be muted and volume is set on the DAC. Spotify can\'t play bit-perfect.</string>
